WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.110
- Have you been trying
to be an influencer?

00:00:02.110 --> 00:00:02.943
I've seen this.

00:00:02.943 --> 00:00:03.776
I follow you.

00:00:03.776 --> 00:00:04.609
You're hysterical.

00:00:04.609 --> 00:00:05.442
- I am hysterical.

00:00:05.442 --> 00:00:06.275
- You are!

00:00:06.275 --> 00:00:07.108
(Whitney laughs)

00:00:07.108 --> 00:00:07.941
You are!

00:00:07.941 --> 00:00:08.774
I'm telling you,

00:00:08.774 --> 00:00:09.607
and I'm being honest,

00:00:09.607 --> 00:00:12.470
like, in such a hard
summer for a lot of us,

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:14.350
it's such nice escapism.

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:15.890
Humor is so healing.

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:16.723
- It's so healing.

00:00:16.723 --> 00:00:17.556
- I'm not joking.

00:00:17.556 --> 00:00:19.317
I literally go on Twitter to find you-

00:00:19.317 --> 00:00:20.150
- Aw, I love you!

00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:22.595
- Just to read your stuff
when I'm having a crap day.

00:00:22.595 --> 00:00:23.428
- I love you!

00:00:23.428 --> 00:00:24.450
- No, 'cause it's funny!

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:25.810
And it's nice, and it's helpful,

00:00:25.810 --> 00:00:27.420
'cause it's like, okay,
we're gonna laugh again

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:28.253
at some point.

00:00:28.253 --> 00:00:30.760
- There's this narrative that
like the country's so divided

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:31.720
and everyone hates each other.

00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:32.810
I don't believe that.

00:00:32.810 --> 00:00:35.090
I think there is a lot of that out there,

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:36.280
but I think that, you know,

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:38.125
I love doing stand-up because
you get a bunch of people

00:00:38.125 --> 00:00:40.050
in a room that don't know each other

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:41.440
and probably voted differently,

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:43.050
and they can all laugh at the same stuff.

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:43.883
You know-

00:00:43.883 --> 00:00:44.716
- Yeah.

00:00:44.716 --> 00:00:45.549
That's how I feel about concerts-

00:00:45.549 --> 00:00:46.382
- Yes! That's what music does, too!

00:00:46.382 --> 00:00:47.390
It brings people together,

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:48.840
and you know, so.

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:50.760
So, during this time,

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:52.915
it's been getting very risky

00:00:52.915 --> 00:00:55.530
in some of the videos
and stuff we're making

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:58.020
just to try to make you
guys laugh at all costs.

00:00:58.020 --> 00:01:00.610
Benton, my assistant, has
been putting me in danger

00:01:00.610 --> 00:01:03.080
constantly to try to
make funny TikTok videos.

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:04.370
- I was gonna say, your TikTok videos,

00:01:04.370 --> 00:01:06.210
the one with the wine
was one of my favorites.

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:07.043
When you're drinking-

00:01:07.043 --> 00:01:08.333
- Well, all my TikTok videos involve wine.

00:01:08.333 --> 00:01:09.166
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:09.166 --> 00:01:11.050
But that one, I just drank it on camera.

00:01:11.050 --> 00:01:11.883
Oh, yes!

00:01:11.883 --> 00:01:12.716
There it is!

00:01:12.716 --> 00:01:13.549
- This is my favorite!

00:01:13.549 --> 00:01:14.382
(Whitney laughs)

00:01:14.382 --> 00:01:16.360
- This is a TikTok challenge
where you try to like

00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:18.310
sort of like put the wine in your mouth

00:01:18.310 --> 00:01:19.330
and the other person drinks it.

00:01:19.330 --> 00:01:20.163
I didn't like it,

00:01:20.163 --> 00:01:21.820
'cause I like the wine
to get down my gullet

00:01:21.820 --> 00:01:22.696
as quickly as possible.

00:01:22.696 --> 00:01:23.645
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:23.645 --> 00:01:25.741
And yeah, so Benton keeps
putting me in all these

00:01:25.741 --> 00:01:28.280
crazy dangerous TikTok challenges,

00:01:28.280 --> 00:01:30.720
which a lot of them are
really actually very scary,

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:31.553
and I have to tell him like,

00:01:31.553 --> 00:01:32.739
"You know you're not in my will, right?"

00:01:32.739 --> 00:01:33.572
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:33.572 --> 00:01:34.405
"If I die..."

00:01:34.405 --> 00:01:36.847
"I don't know why you're
trying to kill me so badly!"

